        <description>GitLab #26635 - Get the community user records to retrieve the &quot;created by&quot; name for use in the body of the action &quot;Bell Notification to Case Owner.&quot; Since it did not support directly fetching the user name, we are utilizing this Get Records to get the user name.</description>
